# UK2.net

> UK2 is a UK-based web hosting, domain registration and email hosting provider, serving UK businesses since 1998. We offer affordable and reliable hosting solutions for small businesses, developers, and individuals - backed by 24/7 UK-based support and a 30-day money-back guarantee. Shared and WordPress hosting run on our hosting platform, powered by 100% renewable energy, with a choice of London, Dallas, or Singapore data centres.

## Core Products & Services

- [UK2 Homepage](https://www.uk2.net/): Web hosting, domains, and email hosting for UK businesses. Affordable plans with UK-based support, 24/7 via phone, live chat, and email.
- [Domain Names](https://www.uk2.net/domain-names/): Register domain names across a wide range of TLDs including .uk, .com, .org, and industry-specific extensions. AI-powered domain name suggestions, a free 1-page website and up to 5 email forwarders with every domain, optional privacy protection, full DNS management, and clear upfront renewal pricing.
- [Web Hosting](https://www.uk2.net/web-hosting/): Shared hosting on our hosting platform with the StackCP control panel. Unlimited free Let's Encrypt SSL certificates (wildcard, auto-installed), free domain with annual plans, free expert website migration, 80+ one-click apps (WordPress, Magento, Joomla, Drupal, OpenCart), autoscaling, free CDN and edge caching, DDoS protection, daily malware scans, email antivirus and anti-spam, PCI-DSS compliance, and unmetered bandwidth. Four plans (Essential to Premier) scale from 1 to unlimited websites. Choice of London, Dallas, or Singapore data centres; powered by 100% renewable energy. 30-day money-back guarantee.
- [WordPress Hosting](https://www.uk2.net/wordpress-hosting/): Managed WordPress hosting on our hosting platform with 3-click installation, automatic core updates, daily backups with 1-click restore, one-click staging environment (no plugins required), integrated Git version control, daily malware scans and removal, unlimited free Let's Encrypt SSL certificates, free domain, and WooCommerce-optimised plans. 24/7 UK support via phone or live chat. Choice of London, Dallas, or Singapore data centres; powered by 100% renewable energy.
- [VPS Hosting](https://www.uk2.net/vps/): Linux virtual private servers with full root access, dedicated resources (1-8 vCPU, 2-16GB RAM, SSD storage), isolated server environments, and a 99.99% uptime guarantee. Free SSL for 1 year with annual plans. Fulfilled by Heart Internet, a specialist hosting provider within our group, on enterprise-grade UK data centres.
- [Email Hosting](https://www.uk2.net/email-hosting/): Professional email addresses at your own domain, hosted on our hosting platform with the multi-language StackMail webmail client. POP/IMAP support, TLS encryption, synchronisation across all devices (iOS/Android), inbound spam and virus protection, personalised junk-mail filters, auto-responders, and up to 100 email addresses per plan. Mailbox storage expandable to 60GB. 30-day money-back guarantee.
- [Website Builder](https://www.uk2.net/website-builder/): AI website builder - enter your business name and a short description and AI creates a complete, professional website in minutes, then refine it with drag-and-drop editing (no code). Includes free domain name, SSL certificate, email hosting, built-in analytics, and mobile-ready themes. Top plans add integrated ecommerce with credit/debit card and PayPal payments and unlimited products.
- [Website Migrations](https://www.uk2.net/migrate/): Free expert-assisted website migration with all UK2 hosting packages - zero downtime, no hidden fees. Our team transfers website files, MySQL/MariaDB databases, and email accounts (via IMAP sync) from cPanel, Plesk, DirectAdmin, and most major hosting providers. Most migrations complete within 24-48 hours.
- [Domain Transfer](https://www.uk2.net/domain-names/domain-transfers/): Transfer your existing domain names to UK2. Free transfers for .co.uk domains; other TLDs include a 1-year registration extension in the transfer fee. Step-by-step guides for transferring from GoDaddy, 123-Reg, Fasthosts, and other registrars (UK2 IPS tag: UK2NET).
- [Website Turbo](https://www.uk2.net/website-turbo/): Speed add-on for Web Hosting and WordPress Hosting packages - high-frequency compute nodes running at up to 4.20GHz, global CDN pre-caching, expanded 5GB MySQL database storage, and no LVE resource limits. One-click setup with zero downtime and no code changes; works with WordPress, WooCommerce, Joomla, Drupal, and PrestaShop.

## Infrastructure & Sustainability

- Shared web hosting and WordPress hosting run on our hosting platform with the StackCP control panel.
- Email hosting also runs on our hosting platform, with the StackMail webmail client.
- A choice of London, Dallas, or Singapore data centres is available for our hosting platform products.
- The data centres for our hosting platform use 100% renewable energy, with a PUE as low as 1.12.
- VPS hosting is fulfilled by Heart Internet (part of our group) on enterprise-grade UK data centres.

## Payments

- Pay at checkout by credit or debit card, Apple Pay, or Google Pay. Apple Pay and Google Pay are offered on supported devices and browsers.

